<div class="sec"><div style="max-width:780px"><span class="k">Why Orion</span><h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:12px">Built for people who run their own things.</h2><p class="lead" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:640px">From a home lab to a small team's production, Orion runs on the machine you choose.</p></div>
<div class="bn">
<div class="cell c7"><h3>Rules decide who hears what</h3><p>Route by monitor, severity or server. The database goes to you, the blog to everyone.</p><svg class="ill" style="right:22px;bottom:18px" width="440" height="250" viewBox="0 0 440 250" fill="none">
